      <section id="sect-00012">
        <title>[H2]Lifespan Tables (and Table Styles from OpenGuide)</title>
        <para id="para-00038">
          The eyes experience a loss of visual acuity in middle age referred to as <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">presbyopia</term>. This results from a thickening of the lens which reduces the amount of light that can reach the retina.
        </para>

        <table id="Table01_01_08" summary="Alt text placeholder">
          <title>Typical Sleep Patterns</title>
          <tgroup cols="3">
            <thead>
              <row>
